# before.* violates a rung on purpose — that is its entire job — paired with an
# after.* that does not. They are instances, not descriptions, so a line marker
# would change the very thing the file demonstrates.
#
# Only before.* is ignored. after.* is ordinary source and stays gated: it is
# the "this is what clean looks like" half, and a regression there is a real
# regression. tests/examples.test.js checks the before.* files with
# `procoder check --no-ignore`, so the detection each one documents is still
# proved on every run.
before.*
